\subsection{Derivation of $\Delta S$ for the spin-boson model}

To compute $\Delta S$, we need to know the expectation values $\langle \sigma_x \rangle$ and $\langle \sigma_z \rangle$ at criticality. Adapting the results of Anderson and Yuval \cite{Anderson:1971}, we find that
