\begin{equation*}
\left\Vert A_{x}\right\Vert _{2} = \sqrt{\rho(A_{x})} = \sqrt{\sum_{i=0}^{n-1} |x_{i}|^{2}}
\end{equation*}

Thus, the main result follows.
